@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>Dalan stores staff/driver accounts, delivery details and delivery proof for fleet operations. Authorized staff can view operational records.</p>
<p>Google Places searches send the text you submit to Google. Google results are shown as text references and are not saved by Dalan or transferred to the delivery map. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
<p>When a driver explicitly starts location sharing, current location is sent to Dalan while deliveries are active, including while the app is minimized with a visible tracking notification. Authorized staff can view vehicle locations and measured movement summaries. Stop sharing in the driver app to end collection. Location samples are retained for 30 days when the cleanup worker is running.</p>
<p>Configured operations summaries are sent through Resend to the recipients configured by the operator. Contact your fleet administrator for account, delivery-proof or location-data questions and deletion requests.</p>
